{"name":"Castellina","hex":"#a27040","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Castellina in Chianti","blocks":[{"text":"Castellina in Chianti is a comune (municipality) of c. 2,800 inhabitants in the province of Siena, in the Italian region Tuscany, located about 35 kilometres (22 mi) south of Florence and about 15 kilometres (9 mi) northwest of Siena. It is part of the Chianti Hills, between the valleys of the Arbia, Pesa and Elsa rivers."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Castellina_in_Chianti.jpg/330px-Castellina_in_Chianti.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castellina_in_Chianti","wikidata":"Q91134"},{"title":"Castellina Marittima","blocks":[{"text":"Castellina Marittima is a comune (municipality) in the province of Pisa in the Italian region Tuscany, located about 70 km (43 mi) southwest of Florence and about 35 km (22 mi) southeast of Pisa."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/CastellinaMarittimaPanorama.JPG/330px-CastellinaMarittimaPanorama.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castellina_Marittima","wikidata":"Q103058"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/1c/Castellina_in_Chianti-Stemma.png/120px-Castellina_in_Chianti-Stemma.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/1c/Castellina_in_Chianti-Stemma.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/1c/Castellina_in_Chianti-Stemma.png/120px-Castellina_in_Chianti-Stemma.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACastellina_in_Chianti-Stemma.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/